/a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white\r\n\n                       transition-transform duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\">Upload Image →</a><p class=\"mt-6 px-4 text-center text-xs\" style=\"color:#8a7a77\">Free · No signup · No uploads</p></div></div></header><main style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:120px 20px 80px;min-height:100vh\"><h1 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-bottom:20px\">Terms of Service</h1><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 24, 2026</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Use of the service</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">BgRemove is provided free of charge, as-is, without warranty. You may use it for personal and commercial projects. You are responsible for the images you process and for confirming that you have permission to edit them. Automatic removal can produce imperfect results; you must review the exported image before relying on it.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Prohibited uses</h2><ul style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:22px\"><li>Processing images you do not have rights to.</li><li>Creating fraudulent ID documents or impersonating others.</li><li>Any use that violates local law in your jurisdiction.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Official document photos</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">Photo requirements differ by document and issuing authority. Check the current official rules before submitting an edited ID or passport photo; BgRemove does not determine whether an image will be accepted.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:10px\">Changes</h2><p style=\"color:#3d2f2c;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75\">We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the service means you accept the current version.</p></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235, 66, 3, 0.18);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,241,239,0) 0%, rgba(235,66,3,0.04) 100%)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"blob pointer-events-none absolute -left-20 top-10 h-56 w-56 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #EB4203, transparent 70%)\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"blob pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 bottom-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full opacity-15 blur-3xl\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, #0a0a0a, transparent 70%);animation-delay:3s\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6 py-14 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 select-none\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-lg text-white\r\n\n      